To accompany the video from my recent talk at 
@aiDotEngineer
, here's an expanded version of my argument that we've seen three key inflection points with LLM over the past twelve months

Five months of intense competition captured in one chart from the Agent Arena Index.


@AnthropicAI
 extends its lead in agentic real-world tasks, while 
@GoogleDeepMind
 has climbed past 
@OpenAI
. Among Chinese labs, 
@Alibaba_Qwen
 and 
@TencentHunyuan
 gain ground, reshaping the field behind the top three.

Dots show best model releases; lines show smoothed trends across all models.

Find the link below to explore the new Agent Arena Index, built on 3.2M agentic sessions (and counting) from our global community of users.

The Index measures how well models get real work done across coding, knowledge work, and conversation. It combines task completion, user praise and complaints, responsiveness to corrections, and Bash reliability into one overall score.
